WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Look for Life Processes. Living things grow, respire, reproduce, respond, excrete, and need nutrients.
Plants and animals are living things.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Movement Is Not Enough. A moving object is not necessarily living. Use several life processes as evidence.
A car moves, but it does not grow or reproduce.

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Seeds and Plants. A seed is living even when it is not visibly growing. Suitable conditions help it germinate.
Green plants need light, water, air, and suitable conditions.

4
00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Compare and Classify. Explain why an example belongs in a group.
A tree is living. A stone is non-living.
